    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
    "body": "The one bugging me is really the indentscope one, but in general, I dislike any animation. So, my question is: Is there an easy way to disable animations that won't interfere later with the config update? Also, how can I disable the animation on indentscope, specifically?",
    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">The one bugging me is really the indentscope one, but in general, I dislike any animation. So, my question is: Is there an easy way to disable animations that won't interfere later with the config update? Also, how can I disable the animation on indentscope, specifically?</p>",
    "bodyText": "The one bugging me is really the indentscope one, but in general, I dislike any animation. So, my question is: Is there an easy way to disable animations that won't interfere later with the config update? Also, how can I disable the animation on indentscope, specifically?",
